  "ruleText": "Fam 202.02 Construction of Rules. Fam 203-Fam 215 shall be construed to secure the just, accurate, and efficient resolution of all disputes.\n\nSource. #8369, eff 6-7-05; ss by #9668, eff 4-2-10; ss by 12633, eff 10-2-18",
